 "title": "The Transforming Wall Street Building",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🏛️",
 "sentences": [
  "This Wall Street building added 5 new floors!",
  "Originally completed in 1841 or 1842, it was the 4-story Merchants' Exchange.",
  "Isaiah Rogers designed it in the Greek Revival style.",
  "Between 1907 and 1910, architects removed the 4th story and built 5 more.",
  "The granite facade includes two stacked colonnades facing Wall Street.",
  "Inside is a cruciform banking hall with a 60-foot vaulted ceiling.",
  "Today, the upper stories are condominiums."
